      "title": "Krea2 Model Guide",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FreeFuse Krea2 - Model & LoRA Guide\n\nRequired model files for ComfyUI:\n\ntext_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n\ndiffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n\nvae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n\nloras/FreeFuse/Krea2/Krea 2 - Kim Possible.safetensors\nloras/FreeFuse/Krea2/Krea 2 - Violet Parr.safetensors\n\nKrea2 uses its own fixed Qwen3-VL chat template inside the text encoder. Do not manually prepend the old Z-Image/Lumina system prompt."
      ],
