      "title": "Krea2 Parameters",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FreeFuse Krea2 - Test Workflow\n\nThis workflow is a two-subject identity-isolation test for Kim Possible and Violet Parr.\n\nRecommended local smoke settings on Apple Silicon:\n- 512x512 or lower first, batch=1\n- steps=4 for smoke, 8-12 for final comparison\n- sampler/scheduler: euler/simple or er_sde/simple depending on local ComfyUI support\n- collect_block / collect_block_end: 10 / 10 initially\n- attention bias blocks: all for the final comparison\n\nFinal README images should compare the same seed/prompt with FreeFuse disabled versus enabled."
      ],
      "color": "#224",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
